<title>FINLAND: Amer lisences Russia cigarette production.</title>
<headline>Amer lisences Russia cigarette production.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish sporting goods and tobacco group Amer-yhtyma said in a statement on Tuesday it would license out cigarette manufacture to Russian partners Nevo Tobacco and SVS-Holding for better penetration of the market.</p>
<p>&quot;Initially production, which is planned to start by the year-end, will be of Amer's Form and Trend branded cigarettes,&quot; Amer said.</p>
</text>
